    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/0e4a2c6b10b89e398e00c8c46e375f64.poster.avif?t=1739751339\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/0e4a2c6b10b89e398e00c8c46e375f64.webm?t=1739751339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/0e4a2c6b10b89e398e00c8c46e375f64.mp4?t=1739751339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i>STORY</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new drug has surfaced on the streets of Portland.\u00a0 The promises of euphoric highs with a chance of permanent madness.\u00a0 Quite the combination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rookie DEA Agent Elena Ramirez is assigned to the case due to her showing of a promising future, and an unusual hunch that may be more than just a &quot;hunch&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The origins of the drug are traced back to the long-forgotten town of Black Hollow - a place once thought to be the next &quot;Sin City&quot; tucked quietly away in the Pacific Northwest.\u00a0 Since its economic collapse in the 90's, few inhabitants remain in the crumbling hollow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon Elena's arrival, she notices something unusual about the area.\u00a0 A crushing darkness suffocates her, the feeling of an ever-watching presence.\u00a0 As Elena explores and uncovers the history of Black Hollow, she learns that there was a much greater cause to the towns demise, one of supernatural origins, and that the &quot;drug&quot; is more than it seems.\u00a0 Something far worse...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/69ec9e9617161e96a8c22d7002c92038.poster.avif?t=1739751339\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/69ec9e9617161e96a8c22d7002c92038.webm?t=1739751339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/69ec9e9617161e96a8c22d7002c92038.mp4?t=1739751339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>FEATURES</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast town of Black Hollow and the areas surrounding it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter an &quot;alternate reality&quot; to solve memory puzzles to unlock areas and reveal lore and story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized, PSX inspired visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-Person OTS with Tank Controls and advanced camera movement for a classic and tense experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense combat and boss encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique puzzle design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sounds and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and skill upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasures and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game + with bonus rewards and tons of lore to explore and secrets to find.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/0e4a2c6b10b89e398e00c8c46e375f64.poster.avif?t=1739751339\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/0e4a2c6b10b89e398e00c8c46e375f64.webm?t=1739751339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/0e4a2c6b10b89e398e00c8c46e375f64.mp4?t=1739751339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i>STORY</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new drug has surfaced on the streets of Portland.\u00a0 The promises of euphoric highs with a chance of permanent madness.\u00a0 Quite the combination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rookie DEA Agent Elena Ramirez is assigned to the case due to her showing of a promising future, and an unusual hunch that may be more than just a &quot;hunch&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The origins of the drug are traced back to the long-forgotten town of Black Hollow - a place once thought to be the next &quot;Sin City&quot; tucked quietly away in the Pacific Northwest.\u00a0 Since its economic collapse in the 90's, few inhabitants remain in the crumbling hollow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon Elena's arrival, she notices something unusual about the area.\u00a0 A crushing darkness suffocates her, the feeling of an ever-watching presence.\u00a0 As Elena explores and uncovers the history of Black Hollow, she learns that there was a much greater cause to the towns demise, one of supernatural origins, and that the &quot;drug&quot; is more than it seems.\u00a0 Something far worse...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/69ec9e9617161e96a8c22d7002c92038.poster.avif?t=1739751339\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/69ec9e9617161e96a8c22d7002c92038.webm?t=1739751339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548800/extras/69ec9e9617161e96a8c22d7002c92038.mp4?t=1739751339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>FEATURES</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast town of Black Hollow and the areas surrounding it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter an &quot;alternate reality&quot; to solve memory puzzles to unlock areas and reveal lore and story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized, PSX inspired visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-Person OTS with Tank Controls and advanced camera movement for a classic and tense experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense combat and boss encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique puzzle design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sounds and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and skill upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasures and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game + with bonus rewards and tons of lore to explore and secrets to find.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore a haunting &quot;Sin City&quot; where you will enter past realities, battle fierce enemies, and solve intricate puzzles in this survival-horror game inspired by classics of the 90s and early 2000s with a new and untraditional story.",
